      title: 'What is learning analytics and where is it going with artificial intelligence?',
      seoTitle: 'Learning analytics and artificial intelligence in education',
      description:
        'Learning analytics and artificial intelligence in education: what data are used, what they can support and what challenges generative AI raises.',
      date: '2026-07-16',
